      "translation": "The farmer says: 'I am a farmer. I am a good and strong person. I have the house. The house is not large, but good. I also have the field — small but good. I love the house and the field. So I dig the field. I see the large stone. So I lift the stone and carry it. For I am strong. I see the sky and the great sun. The sun shines and is beautiful. I have bread and fruit. I eat and rejoice. God is good and faithful.'"
